WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.490
Hi This is Steve Kaufmann.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:06.740
Today I am going to talk about

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:11.940
why listening is important.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.000
How do we use “listening”

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.480
effectively as strategy for our studying.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.930
If you like my channel, please subscribe.

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:32.620
Click the bell,

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:36.000
you’ll get the notification.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.260
If you are listening to podcast

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:41.630
leave comments.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:45.140
I would appreciate it

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:50.740
So if you’ve been watching my videos

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:56.010
Today’s theme is

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:59.740
 “Listen” and “Read” 
That is the key

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:03.010
Language is not in your mind

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:07.870
It needs to come inside your mind

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:10.890
That’s why you have to listen a lot

00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:13.800
read a lot

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.220
Reading is also an essential thing

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:25.220
Take a look the bookshelf behind my back

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.370
Reading is a good thing

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:32.320
But listening, “Listening”

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:38.900
You can do it anytime 
with this recent technology of MP3

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:45.020
there are so many variations of 
interesting contents that

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:51.840
you can find and download
listen to it on the internet

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.220
We live in this great time

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:59.640
Wake up in the morning and 
while preparing breakfast I listen to them

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:04.090
Now I am studying Arabic and Persian

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:08.450
Listening is so easy 
You don’t need to prepare anything

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:11.630
Just pick up my iPhone

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:17.700
put AirPods and there we go
It’s done

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:22.180
But when I listen to it 
I don’t understand everything

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:25.600
I understand 30% or 70% 60%

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:27.940
And there’s always some part 
that I don’t understand 

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:30.330
Since there is a part I don’t understand

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.230
I want to read

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:35.250
Makes me want to read

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:38.880
I search the part I couldn’t understand

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.520
the word you don’t know when you read

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:45.410
for example you don’t know the word 
called ‘Link’ then I search “link” and save it

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:47.950
And I listen to it one more time

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:51.000
I understand little bit better than before
but sometimes still cannot understand 

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.100
This is the process of studying

00:02:53.100 --> 00:03:03.300
When you start studying new language 
and you aren’t that good

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:07.920
Then you should repeatedly 
listen to the same contents

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:13.460
I always do this process when I begin

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:14.820
Repeatedly listen to it

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.180
Let me explain one more time

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:26.710
What do we need for our brain is 
“Repeat” and “New thing”

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:28.130
We need both of them

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:32.440
When you only repeat the same thing
Our brain gets tired and it’s not fun anymore

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:37.970
therefore you end up learning nothing 
That’s why we need something new and fun

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:40.830
We give them to our brain

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:46.670
The important thing is while you are 
listening and reading new content

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:52.990
Sometimes you should go back to the beginning 
and repeatedly listen to the easiest one

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:59.100
Because you will have noticed that
you missed so many parts in the past

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:04.860
And after you listen and read 
new and more difficult ones

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:07.180
You should go back to the beginning and

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:11.010
listen to the one 
That you already have listened 30times

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:14.430
You listen to it one more time 
while preparing breakfast

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:22.490
You’ll suddenly notice there’s a 
structure of sentences and words 

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:35.770
This 31time of listening would help to
use or understanding those sentences and words

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:37.980
That’s why we need variety of contents

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:43.840
This listening strategy is about repeating

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:49.570
The first 3,6month
You will get to understand new words

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:52.520
And then you should listen to the 
same content over and over

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:56.640
The best way is using 
mini stories from LingQ

00:04:56.640 --> 00:05:04.840
Each stories using the same words 
around 5times

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:07.830
Repeatedly using the same words

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:14.200
And you should listen to 
each stories 20,30times

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.060
Don’t listen to all the stories at once

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:21.400
You should listen to them
like 12345 and then 123456

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:25.350
then 12345678 just like this

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:31.940
In the end you’ll end up listening to
each stories 30times 

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:39.560
This way create the 
connection inside our brain

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:42.230
But as I have explained

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:45.830
Only repeating would be boring for brain 

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:49.950
It’s not fun and can not 
remember effectively

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.570
That’s why

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:54.530
We need to challenge something new

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:57.220
Therefore learning strategy changes little

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:03.550
I listen to interesting content over and over

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:16.930
because of getting used to those
new words and sentences 

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:20.100
So new content has new words

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:27.500
I don’t listen to those contents for studying

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:31.940
I listen to them because it’s interesting

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:39.000
While you enjoy listening and reading
Your level of language get

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.780
better and better without knowing

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:46.750
You listen to content for study 

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:51.990
And when the number of 
listening increases 

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:57.200
Then you should move on to 
new and interesting one and “ Listen and Read”

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:02.790
It can be series on Netflix 

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:08.680
To enjoy it you do “ listen and read”

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:12.460
Overall your level of words increases

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:20.250
And sometimes you repeatedly 
listen to something easy like Mini stories 

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:25.140
This would be affective way of learning

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:28.000
When you listen

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:32.860
You don’t need to listen to it fully
This is impossible

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:36.460
One of good thing about listening is

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:38.080
You can do anytime anywhere

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:45.180
Therefore you can do while driving the car
Inside train, while washing dishes

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:49.680
That’s why you cannot concentrate 100% 

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:52.460
But it’s OK

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:55.610
60% 70% 80% that’s enough

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:58.000
The funny thing is

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:07.000
Let’s say I sit down here
and concentrate on listening 

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.290
I can’t

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:12.990
If I listen to it 
while doing something 

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:15.110
I can listen 60,70%

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:20.660
Sometimes thinking about 
something else

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:24.510
and come back afterwards 
That’s better 

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:31.070
I sit down here and 
listen to something for 5 min

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:37.790
Everybody aren’t the same 
but I believe 

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:45.970
Listening doesn’t mean 
concentrating on it 100%

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:50.080
If you could concentrate 10,30,50%

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:56.410
The amount you did concentrate 
would become part of you

00:08:56.410 --> 00:09:04.840
So if you are beginner you should use 
the strategy of enjoying and repeating

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:07.020
As number of listening session increasing  

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.890
Then switch to something interesting

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:15.970
You should read if you couldn’t understand 
Open your iPad and use LingQ to read

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:25.240
But you don’t need to 
concentrate or understand 100%.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:31.000
It’s like rain of words.

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:37.120
It’s all good when your brain gets wet 
by shower of words.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:42.400
So today’s topic was about “Listening“.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:45.640
Thank you all for listening.

